#1800
Stone Bridge~
   You are standing on an old stone bridge crossing the Widmans River,
its arch worn smooth by centuries of travelers and its parapets green
with moss.  The water rushes dark and fast below.  The town of Elrhinn
lies directly to the north, and you can still faintly hear the bustle
from within its walls.  To the south rises an ancient forest, dark with
old trees swaying slightly in the breeze.  You sense something not quite
right about it.
~
