#1801
Entrance to Darkweir Hallow~
   Two gnarled trees have been magically bent and entwined together to
form a natural archway into Darkweir Hallows.  Strange, foreign
inscriptions are etched into the living bark of the arch, and they seem
to shift slightly when you are not looking straight at them.  It appears
to be some sort of ancient druidic ward meant to keep evil out of the
forest.  You hope it has lasted this long.  The bridge lies to the
north, and a path leads south into the trees.
~
