#1802
Up in a Tall Tree~
   You are perched high in a tall tree that overlooks the entire forest.
A gentle breeze cools you as it sweeps by, setting the branches swaying
beneath your feet.  A magnificent town lies to the northeast, its walls
and rooftops tiny in the distance, and to the south you see a tree even
taller than the one you are in.  The way down leads back to the edge of
the forest.
~
