Before the Druidic Temple~
   You stand before a small, crumbling temple that rises barely five
feet high.  It is too poorly built to be dwarven and too tall to be
gnomish; perhaps an ancient race of elvish druids built it.  Strange
markings are carved on the archway into the temple, like this:
##*|***>><<***|*##, and a message has been scrawled across the stones in
animal blood.  The archway leads east into the temple, and the cliff's
edge runs north and south.
