#1822
Entrance to the Ancient Drerim Temple~
   It is said that the Clan of Drerim once ruled this forest: a cabal of
druids who despised the creatures of the woods and worshipped Gray and
all his evil philosophies.  Legends tell of terrible cruelties they
worked on the beasts of Darkweir, until the Forestmaster came into the
Dominion and took control of the woodlands, leading an army of skilled
rangers and the mightiest of the forest's animals against them.  This
temple is the last of the Drerim Clan's, left in ruins as a reminder to
all evil of the price of disturbing the forest.  Cracked pillars lean
overhead, and a stairway leads on to the east.  The way out lies west.
~
