E
rules crest~
Beneath a large black star with a blood red sword passing through it
is a large scroll with several things written upon it.

1.  Members of the Ebon Hand Clan are an elite force of killers which
    can never leave the clan once they have joined.

2.  You are to follow the orders of the acting Template of the Clan, who's
    identity will always remain a secret.  If you receive orders or a mission
    you must act out your orders swiftly and with extreme efficiency.

3.  If you do not or can not carry out any order, you must notify the
    Template's proxy.

4.   We are here to bring Evil to everlasting power through strategic
     tactics and killing missions.  No killing in the name of the Ebon 
     Hand.  You may kill at will but it will not be in the name of the
     Ebon Hand unless you are under orders or you have been directly 
     attacked by an enemy clan.  As of now there is only one other clan, 
     the Night Tribe.  They are to be treated with respect unless you 
     are under orders to undermine their power.

5.  You have the right to refuse a mission if it conflicts with your
    religious beliefs but remember that you will most likely be less
    likely to receive orders again.  

6.  You are NOT to hold the Banner of the Ebon Cross UNLESS you are    
    on a mission given to you by the proxy of the Template.

	- the High Template of the Ebon Cross
~
